      "trackName": "Tunnel Ball: Watch Retro Run",
      "description": "Experience the retro-futuristic rush directly on your Apple Watch.\n\nControl a neon ball as it hurtles through a 3D cyber tunnel. Built specifically for the Digital Crown, this game tests your reflexes with precision movement and increasing velocity.\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n\nPrecision Control: Use the Digital Crown for smooth, 1:1 movement accuracy.\nCyberpunk Aesthetic: Immerse yourself in a high-contrast world of deep purples, vibrant cyans, and glowing walls.\nInstant Action: No load times, just launch and play, perfect for quick breaks.\nProgressive Difficulty: Survive faster speeds and trickier obstacle patterns as you aim for the Finish Gate.\nMaster the curves. Dodge the barriers. Reach the gate.",
